cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this reverse-engineering study, please cite it as below."
title: "TypingMaster 12.0.1.981 — Reversed Source Tree"
abstract: >-
  A complete, runnable copy of the TypingMaster 12.0.1.981 program tree
  (Windows/Delphi VCL, run under Wine), together with the reverse-engineering
  artifacts used to study it: a live-memory dump of the decrypted image, a
  Ghidra decompilation (13,137 functions), extracted PE resources, RTTI-derived
  class and event-handler maps, and full documentation. Licensing logic is
  documented structurally only; no bypass is provided.
